  "description": "If Amber Verdi had known a goddess was a fan of her novel, she never would’ve discontinued writing it. Unfortunately, she’s angered a goddess. And as punishment, she must become a side character and help the female and male leads, Freya Ardel and Kyle Blackwood, reach a happy ending. But when Freya suddenly dies as a result of her actions, she manages to pacify the enraged goddess once again by becoming the new heroine of the story. Will Amber's journey with Kyle bring a satisfying conclusion for her most extreme fan? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
